{"route":"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/","title":"Data Quality Dimensions | Data Foundations Tutorial","description":"Data quality is fitness for use, not a single score. Evaluate completeness, validity, accuracy, consistency, uniqueness, timeliness, and representativeness in context.","canonical":"https://datalearninghub.netlify.app/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/","bodyAttrs":{"data-page":"tutorial-chapter","data-tutorial":"data-foundations","data-chapter":"data-quality-dimensions"},"mainHtml":"<main id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"tutorial-layout\">\n<aside class=\"tutorial-sidebar\" id=\"tutorial-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-head\">\n<a class=\"tutorial-course-title\" data-bn=\"ডেটা ফাউন্ডেশন\" data-en=\"Data Foundations\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/\">Data Foundations</a>\n<button aria-label=\"Close chapter menu\" class=\"icon-button tutorial-drawer-close\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-close\" type=\"button\">×</button>\n</div>\n<label class=\"tutorial-sidebar-search\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Search chapters</span><input data-placeholder-bn=\"Chapter খুঁজুন…\" data-placeholder-en=\"Search chapters…\" id=\"tutorial-chapter-search\" placeholder=\"Search chapters…\" type=\"search\"/></label>\n<div class=\"tutorial-progress-mini\"><div><span data-bn=\"Course progress\" data-en=\"Course progress\">Course progress</span><strong id=\"tutorial-progress-label\">0/21</strong></div><div class=\"progress-track\"><span id=\"tutorial-progress-bar\" style=\"width:0\"></span></div></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"Course chapters\" class=\"tutorial-chapter-nav\"><div class=\"tutorial-module-links\"><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"welcome-to-data-analytics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/welcome-to-data-analytics/\"><span>01</span><span data-bn=\"ডেটা অ্যানালিটিক্সে স্বাগতম\" data-en=\"Welcome to Data Analytics\">Welcome to Data Analytics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-and-statistics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-and-statistics/\"><span>02</span><span data-bn=\"ডেটা ও স্ট্যাটিস্টিকস\" data-en=\"Data and Statistics\">Data and Statistics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"observations-variables-and-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/observations-variables-and-values/\"><span>03</span><span data-bn=\"Observation, Variable ও Value\" data-en=\"Observations, Variables, and Values\">Observations, Variables, and Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"rows-columns-tables-and-datasets\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/rows-columns-tables-and-datasets/\"><span>04</span><span data-bn=\"Row, Column, Table ও Dataset\" data-en=\"Rows, Columns, Tables, and Datasets\">Rows, Columns, Tables, and Datasets</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"categorical-and-numerical-data\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/categorical-and-numerical-data/\"><span>05</span><span data-bn=\"Categorical ও Numerical Data\" data-en=\"Categorical and Numerical Data\">Categorical and Numerical Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"discrete-and-continuous-data\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/discrete-and-continuous-data/\"><span>06</span><span data-bn=\"Discrete ও Continuous Data\" data-en=\"Discrete and Continuous Data\">Discrete and Continuous Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"measurement-scales\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/measurement-scales/\"><span>07</span><span data-bn=\"Measurement Scale\" data-en=\"Measurement Scales\">Measurement Scales</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-structures-and-formats\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-structures-and-formats/\"><span>08</span><span data-bn=\"Structured, Semi-structured ও Unstructured Data\" data-en=\"Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data\">Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-sources-and-collection\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/\"><span>09</span><span data-bn=\"Data Source ও Collection Method\" data-en=\"Data Sources and Collection Methods\">Data Sources and Collection Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"population-sample-parameter-and-statistic\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/population-sample-parameter-and-statistic/\"><span>10</span><span data-bn=\"Population, Sample, Parameter ও Statistic\" data-en=\"Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic\">Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"sampling-methods\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/\"><span>11</span><span data-bn=\"Sampling Method\" data-en=\"Sampling Methods\">Sampling Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"bias-confounding-and-error\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/bias-confounding-and-error/\"><span>12</span><span data-bn=\"Bias, Confounding ও Error\" data-en=\"Bias, Confounding, and Error\">Bias, Confounding, and Error</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link current\" data-chapter-link=\"data-quality-dimensions\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><span>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"data-quality-dimensions\" data-tutorial=\"data-foundations\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 13 / 21\" data-en=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 13 of 21\">Data Foundations · Chapter 13 of 21</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Data quality একটি single score নয়; fitness for use। Context অনুযায়ী completeness, validity, accuracy, consistency, uniqueness, timeliness ও representativeness evaluate করুন।\" data-en=\"Data quality is fitness for use, not a single score. Evaluate completeness, validity, accuracy, consistency, uniqueness, timeliness, and representativeness in context.\">Data quality is fitness for use, not a single score. Evaluate completeness, validity, accuracy, consistency, uniqueness, timeliness, and representativeness in context.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 50 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Major data-quality dimension define করুন।\" data-en=\"Define major data-quality dimensions.\">Define major data-quality dimensions.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Validity ও accuracy আলাদা করুন।\" data-en=\"Separate validity from accuracy.\">Separate validity from accuracy.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Measurable quality check তৈরি করুন।\" data-en=\"Create measurable quality checks.\">Create measurable quality checks.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Specific decision-এর জন্য fitness judge করুন।\" data-en=\"Judge fitness for a specific decision.\">Judge fitness for a specific decision.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Fitness for use\" data-en=\"Fitness for use\">Fitness for use</h2><p data-bn=\"Quality intended use-এর ওপর নির্ভর করে। Dataset weekly operational monitoring-এর জন্য adequate কিন্তু audit বা causal study-এর জন্য insufficient হতে পারে। “Good” বলার আগে decision, granularity, delay ও error tolerance define করুন।\" data-en=\"Quality depends on the intended use. A dataset may be adequate for weekly operational monitoring but insufficient for an audit or causal study. Define the decision, required granularity, acceptable delay, and error tolerance before declaring data “good.”\">Quality depends on the intended use. A dataset may be adequate for weekly operational monitoring but insufficient for an audit or causal study. Define the decision, required granularity, acceptable delay, and error tolerance before declaring data “good.”</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Core dimension\" data-en=\"Core dimensions\">Core dimensions</h2><p data-bn=\"Completeness required value/record আছে কি না। Validity rule follow করে কি না। Accuracy reality reflect করে কি না। Consistency field/system agreement। Uniqueness duplicate entity/event। Timeliness সময়মতো data। Representativeness important group ও period coverage।\" data-en=\"Completeness asks whether required values and records exist. Validity asks whether values follow rules. Accuracy asks whether values reflect reality. Consistency checks agreement across fields or systems. Uniqueness detects duplicate entities or events. Timeliness measures whether data arrive when needed. Representativeness considers whether important groups and periods are covered.\">Completeness asks whether required values and records exist. Validity asks whether values follow rules. Accuracy asks whether values reflect reality. Consistency checks agreement across fields or systems. Uniqueness detects duplicate entities or events. Timeliness measures whether data arrive when needed. Representativeness considers whether important groups and periods are covered.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Rule ও evidence\" data-en=\"Rules and evidence\">Rules and evidence</h2><p data-bn=\"Validity rule quantity nonnegative verify করতে পারে, কিন্তু accuracy prove করে না। Accuracy trusted source, reconciliation, observation বা audit comparison প্রয়োজন। Quality check count, percentage, affected field, severity ও action report করবে।\" data-en=\"A validity rule can verify that quantity is nonnegative, but it cannot prove the number is accurate. Accuracy often requires comparison with trusted sources, reconciliation, observation, or audits. Quality checks should report counts, percentages, affected fields, severity, and action.\">A validity rule can verify that quantity is nonnegative, but it cannot prove the number is accurate. Accuracy often requires comparison with trusted sources, reconciliation, observation, or audits. Quality checks should report counts, percentages, affected fields, severity, and action.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-4\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">04</div><h2 data-bn=\"Quality trade-off\" data-en=\"Quality trade-offs\">Quality trade-offs</h2><p data-bn=\"এক dimension improve করলে অন্যটি affect হতে পারে: complete record-এর জন্য wait timeliness কমায়; aggressive duplicate removal distinct person merge করতে পারে। Blind rule নয়, threshold document ও uncertain case review করুন।\" data-en=\"Improving one dimension may affect another: waiting for complete records can reduce timeliness; aggressive duplicate removal can merge distinct people. Document thresholds and review uncertain cases rather than applying blind rules.\">Improving one dimension may affect another: waiting for complete records can reduce timeliness; aggressive duplicate removal can merge distinct people. Document thresholds and review uncertain cases rather than applying blind rules.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Completeness\" data-en=\"Completeness\">Completeness</h3><p data-bn=\"Required record ও value-এর presence।\" data-en=\"Presence of required records and values.\">Presence of required records and values.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Validity\" data-en=\"Validity\">Validity</h3><p data-bn=\"Defined format, range ও rule conform করা।\" data-en=\"Conformance to defined formats, ranges, and rules.\">Conformance to defined formats, ranges, and rules.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Accuracy\" data-en=\"Accuracy\">Accuracy</h3><p data-bn=\"Recorded data reality বা trusted reference-এর কাছাকাছি হওয়া।\" data-en=\"Closeness of recorded data to reality or a trusted reference.\">Closeness of recorded data to reality or a trusted reference.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Consistency\" data-en=\"Consistency\">Consistency</h3><p data-bn=\"Data source-এর within ও across logical agreement।\" data-en=\"Logical agreement within and across data sources.\">Logical agreement within and across data sources.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"Retail sales file audit\" data-en=\"Auditing a retail sales file\">Auditing a retail sales file</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"CSV-তে 240 sales row এবং order date, quantity, price, region ও revenue আছে।\" data-en=\"A CSV has 240 sales rows with order dates, quantities, prices, regions, and revenue.\">A CSV has 240 sales rows with order dates, quantities, prices, regions, and revenue.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"Required field-এর missingness measure করুন।\" data-en=\"Measure missingness for required fields.\">Measure missingness for required fields.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"Date, positive quantity, allowed region ও revenue arithmetic validate করুন।\" data-en=\"Validate dates, positive quantities, allowed regions, and revenue arithmetic.\">Validate dates, positive quantities, allowed regions, and revenue arithmetic.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"Duplicate order-line key check করুন।\" data-en=\"Check duplicate order-line keys.\">Check duplicate order-line keys.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Trusted report থাকলে total reconcile করুন।\" data-en=\"Reconcile totals with a trusted report if available.\">Reconcile totals with a trusted report if available.</p></li><li><span>5</span><p data-bn=\"Quality finding business finding থেকে আলাদা report করুন।\" data-en=\"Report quality findings separately from business findings.\">Report quality findings separately from business findings.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Transparent quality report কী check, কী fail এবং finding interpretation-কে কীভাবে affect করে তা জানায়।\" data-en=\"A transparent quality report tells users what was checked, what failed, and how findings affect interpretation.\">A transparent quality report tells users what was checked, what failed, and how findings affect interpretation.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Quality হলো defined use-এর fitness।\" data-en=\"Quality is fitness for a defined use.\">Quality is fitness for a defined use.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Validity accuracy prove করে না।\" data-en=\"Validity does not prove accuracy.\">Validity does not prove accuracy.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Quality check-এর measurable rule প্রয়োজন।\" data-en=\"Quality checks need measurable rules.\">Quality checks need measurable rules.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Analytical result-এর সঙ্গে quality limitation report করুন।\" data-en=\"Report quality limitations with analytical results.\">Report quality limitations with analytical results.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://unstats.un.org/UNSDWebsite/data-quality\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">United Nations Statistics Division — Data Quality ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/SpecialPublications/1500-18/NIST.SP.1500-18r2.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIST Research Data Framework ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/bias-confounding-and-error/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Bias, Confounding ও Error\" data-en=\"Bias, Confounding, and Error\">Bias, Confounding, and Error</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}